 "text": "The stethoscope was invented because a doctor felt awkward. 1816, Paris. Dr. Ren\u00e9 Laennec has a young female patient with heart trouble. Back then, doctors listened by pressing an ear right against the chest. Laennec thinks that's improper, so he rolls a sheet of paper into a tube and listens through it. He can hear her heart better than ever. He builds a wooden version and calls it the stethoscope, Greek for chest and examine. Every legend has a beginning.",
